WEBVTT

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:09.117
Oh, my. Who's that?
That young aristocrat over there.

00:00:09.186 --> 00:00:13.691
Those exotic eyes and that shining silver hair...

00:00:13.691 --> 00:00:15.626
Oh, the mysterious Orient!

00:00:15.626 --> 00:00:17.958
And the wild-looking one
next to him isn't bad, either.

00:00:18.929 --> 00:00:20.726
Really! They're gorgeous!

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:25.736
Magi, you've got to loosen up!

00:00:25.736 --> 00:00:27.738
Why don't you try to enjoy yourself a little?

00:00:27.738 --> 00:00:29.763
I didn't come here to have fun!

00:00:30.107 --> 00:00:33.133
Don't be embarrassed.
You're just unusually inexperienced.

00:00:33.377 --> 00:00:34.537
Wh-Who is?!

00:00:34.979 --> 00:00:37.777
Now then, shall we get things started?

00:00:43.387 --> 00:00:46.288
Um, attention, ladies
and gentlemen gathered here.

00:00:47.925 --> 00:00:50.519
This vessel has just been occupied by PANDRA.

00:00:51.028 --> 00:00:53.826
Those who value their lives should
please head for the life boats.

00:00:55.599 --> 00:01:02.698
Strongly, gallantly, I beat my wings

00:01:03.707 --> 00:01:09.577
Zettai Karen Children

00:01:12.016 --> 00:01:17.818
Meeting you like I did

00:01:18.155 --> 00:01:23.024
Wasn't just so we could live

00:01:24.295 --> 00:01:29.824
Tiny wishes, cross through time

00:01:30.234 --> 00:01:34.830
And surely change the future

00:01:35.439 --> 00:01:38.342
When my limiter (changing myself)

00:01:38.342 --> 00:01:41.470
Is released (changing yourself)

00:01:41.612 --> 00:01:47.346
An angel's shining surges through me

00:01:48.786 --> 00:01:51.355
The "wings" that will save the world

00:01:51.355 --> 00:01:54.188
Now I'm on the path I chose

00:01:54.425 --> 00:02:00.591
And I want to grab my dreams (Can't stop)

00:02:00.731 --> 00:02:03.534
The power given to me

00:02:03.534 --> 00:02:06.170
Spurs me into the sky

00:02:06.170 --> 00:02:11.904
Strongly, gallantly, I beat my wings

00:02:12.243 --> 00:02:17.772
Absolutely lovely, my wings

00:02:25.723 --> 00:02:27.782
51st sense:
"A Riot of Cherry Blossoms!
Bye-Bye, Till We Meet Again"

00:02:28.325 --> 00:02:31.021
BIG MAGNUM!

00:02:36.700 --> 00:02:39.464
Yay! We can eat all the potato
chips we want with this!

00:02:39.537 --> 00:02:41.664
Sky Devil Flying Squirrel Dive!

00:02:42.773 --> 00:02:44.638
Does it suit me? Does it?

00:02:44.775 --> 00:02:45.969
Not a bit!

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:54.110
So, you're the little esper punk who's
been muscling in on my turf lately.

00:02:54.852 --> 00:02:57.480
You've got guts to attack me here like this.

00:03:04.495 --> 00:03:06.897
Oh, surely you're not going
to just end it like that.

00:03:06.897 --> 00:03:08.592
Give me a little more fun, please.

00:03:13.437 --> 00:03:14.995
Well done, Ali.

00:03:16.807 --> 00:03:19.410
That's it? Hardly worth the effort.

00:03:19.410 --> 00:03:21.674
Really! You burnt me to a crisp.

00:03:24.715 --> 00:03:26.046
Why, you!

00:03:29.086 --> 00:03:29.848
Kill me.

00:03:31.488 --> 00:03:33.820
You're loyal enough to die for a guy like this?

00:03:34.625 --> 00:03:39.028
Is it really so satisfying to be used
as a hired goon by this Normal?

00:03:39.463 --> 00:03:40.191
What are you?

00:03:40.531 --> 00:03:43.557
Haven't you ever thought you'd like
to see a world just for espers?

00:03:44.034 --> 00:03:47.561
That we are God's chosen?

00:03:57.214 --> 00:03:59.250
All of them are espers?

00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:01.411
The family's about to grow again.

00:04:02.219 --> 00:04:03.811
The more, the merrier, right?

00:04:10.661 --> 00:04:11.650
What's your name?

00:04:14.999 --> 00:04:15.863
Dolly.

00:04:17.067 --> 00:04:18.135
Cheers!

00:04:18.135 --> 00:04:21.536
Yay! Yay!

00:04:25.075 --> 00:04:27.077
Have a drink.

00:04:27.077 --> 00:04:28.669
To mark your becoming one of us.

00:04:37.488 --> 00:04:39.456
Good job, everyone.

00:04:39.957 --> 00:04:44.860
But many more espers around the world
are waiting for PANDRA to rescue them.

00:04:45.129 --> 00:04:47.598
Right! Leave it to us, Major!

00:04:47.598 --> 00:04:49.896
We'll do our best, too!

00:04:52.269 --> 00:04:55.139
It must have been tough,
getting rejected by Kaoru and the others.

00:04:55.139 --> 00:04:57.471
Don't be shy! Come on over here!

00:04:57.841 --> 00:05:00.867
Don't act like you're doing a heartbreak
trip with me, you perverted rodent!

00:05:10.387 --> 00:05:14.118
Now that you mention it, I wonder
what those girls are up to right now.

00:05:14.758 --> 00:05:17.522
It should be about time for
summer vacation in Japan now.

00:05:21.131 --> 00:05:25.033
C'mon, Minamoto! Take us to the beach!

00:05:25.436 --> 00:05:27.938
Summer vacation's almost over!

00:05:27.938 --> 00:05:29.073
Forget it!

00:05:29.073 --> 00:05:32.209
You three haven't done any of your
summer assignments, have you?

00:05:32.209 --> 00:05:34.803
I want some of it complete when I get back!

00:05:35.346 --> 00:05:37.610
Darn it! What's with him?

00:05:38.115 --> 00:05:43.287
There, there. Mr. Minamoto's just
looking out for your best interests.

00:05:43.287 --> 00:05:46.051
Ask me about any parts you don't understand!

00:05:46.357 --> 00:05:49.193
You're telling me this is for our own good?

00:05:49.193 --> 00:05:51.628
Where's the love here? Nowhere!

00:05:51.628 --> 00:05:54.765
Darn it, he always just treats us like kids!

00:05:54.765 --> 00:05:58.257
Let's go to the pool, at least! This is so boring!

00:06:02.406 --> 00:06:03.930
I just need your stamp on this.

00:06:09.513 --> 00:06:13.313
Paid vacation, huh? Family leave?

00:06:14.351 --> 00:06:17.254
They keep begging me
to take them to the beach.

00:06:17.254 --> 00:06:20.121
Like they say, "No child
realizes their parent's love."

00:06:20.357 --> 00:06:23.160
No, I think you're doing just fine there.

00:06:23.160 --> 00:06:25.321
Even with that probability level. Look!

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:29.166
It's taken a turn for the better.

00:06:29.166 --> 00:06:34.536
Angel, 42%. Devil, 46% Unknown, 12%.

00:06:34.972 --> 00:06:37.207
That means it's just changed only a few percent!

00:06:37.207 --> 00:06:40.310
No, it may be little, but it's a big first step.

00:06:40.310 --> 00:06:43.336
Have more faith in the bond
you share with The Children!

00:06:44.515 --> 00:06:45.816
Director...

00:06:45.816 --> 00:06:48.546
Little girls grow up in the blink of an eye.

00:06:49.153 --> 00:06:53.055
Gently watch over them and raise
them to be honest adults, all right?

00:06:54.024 --> 00:06:54.786
Yes, ma'am!

00:06:55.292 --> 00:06:57.828
By the way, what about that predicted incident?

00:06:57.828 --> 00:07:00.664
I can get them ready if you need them for it.

00:07:00.664 --> 00:07:03.700
Hm? Oh, we'll be fine.

00:07:03.700 --> 00:07:05.736
It's nothing major.

00:07:05.736 --> 00:07:08.534
I expect we can handle it
without needing Level 7 s.

00:07:09.540 --> 00:07:11.809
I'm coming to you from in front
of the Energy corporation,

00:07:11.809 --> 00:07:13.677
where a criminal has barricaded himself inside.

00:07:13.677 --> 00:07:15.913
The terrorist has issued a
statement to all media outlets...

00:07:15.913 --> 00:07:19.076
that this is in protest of the dismissal
of all esper blue-collar workers there.

00:07:27.925 --> 00:07:30.327
All right, and the man inside blows himself up!

00:07:30.327 --> 00:07:33.730
By the time the cops realize
there's no dead body, I'll be...

00:07:33.730 --> 00:07:34.822
There he is!

00:07:35.165 --> 00:07:36.800
Get the ESP cuffs on him!

00:07:36.800 --> 00:07:37.562
Crap!

00:07:39.069 --> 00:07:40.559
How'd they know where I was?!

00:07:41.972 --> 00:07:43.640
There he is, Hatsune! Over here!

00:07:43.640 --> 00:07:44.368
Roger!

00:07:49.279 --> 00:07:50.837
You're a special esper?

00:07:51.782 --> 00:07:53.113
Exactly!

00:07:58.021 --> 00:08:00.888
The red hot beauty: Hatsune Inugami!

00:08:03.060 --> 00:08:05.085
The dove who flies alone: Akira Yadorigi!

00:08:06.530 --> 00:08:08.430
Um, uh... Uh...

00:08:08.665 --> 00:08:09.689
Kojika!

00:08:10.667 --> 00:08:13.636
These strange creatures are in BABEL!
Or something!

00:08:13.904 --> 00:08:16.498
Where there is life, there is our howl of justice!

00:08:17.107 --> 00:08:19.667
The Hound has arrived!

00:08:20.844 --> 00:08:21.902
We got it!

00:08:22.412 --> 00:08:25.609
Hatsune was so cool!
We have to do this every time!

00:08:25.916 --> 00:08:28.585
Hey! This is no time to be admiring yourself!

00:08:28.585 --> 00:08:29.847
Our suspect's getting away!

00:08:31.955 --> 00:08:35.015
We finally got it right and
he ignored us?! How dare he!

00:08:40.964 --> 00:08:42.232
What is it?!

00:08:42.232 --> 00:08:43.800
Is it an emergency?!

00:08:43.800 --> 00:08:48.639
Yes. We and the police are in
pursuit of an esper criminal, but...

00:08:48.639 --> 00:08:51.108
He's giving The Hound a tough time.

00:08:51.108 --> 00:08:52.976
Hatsune, calm down!

00:08:52.976 --> 00:08:55.001
Don't let the enemy's powers throw you off!

00:08:56.947 --> 00:08:59.711
Heh! Catch me if you can!

00:09:06.356 --> 00:09:07.254
Hatsune, look out!

00:09:13.096 --> 00:09:15.532
All right, let's scramble!

00:09:15.532 --> 00:09:17.432
That's gotta be way more fun
than doing homework!

00:09:18.235 --> 00:09:21.038
Dammit, at this rate, we're gonna lose him!

00:09:21.038 --> 00:09:24.875
Akira, time to pass the baton.
We'll take it from here.

00:09:24.875 --> 00:09:25.842
Miss Nowaki!

00:09:26.076 --> 00:09:31.207
Target currently 200 meters to the east,
headed north on Highway 9.

00:09:31.348 --> 00:09:32.783
Tobio Tobita.

00:09:32.783 --> 00:09:35.581
An esper hooligan working
as a low-level gang thug.

00:09:35.886 --> 00:09:37.754
Huh? He's not a terrorist?

00:09:37.754 --> 00:09:41.315
He probably spread that story
for some sort of benefit.

00:09:41.725 --> 00:09:43.994
He's a Level 5, meaning there's a limit...

00:09:43.994 --> 00:09:46.396
on the range and frequency of his jumps.

00:09:46.396 --> 00:09:49.627
Wear him out, then capture him. Got it?

00:09:50.233 --> 00:09:51.257
Roger!

00:09:53.570 --> 00:09:55.504
This is pissing me off! But...

00:10:01.044 --> 00:10:03.513
You can't turn as tightly as I can in the city!

00:10:03.513 --> 00:10:05.248
I'll shake you loose!

00:10:05.248 --> 00:10:07.045
No, you won't!

00:10:07.451 --> 00:10:08.318
What?!

00:10:08.318 --> 00:10:11.955
Nice idea, teleporting while riding your bike!

00:10:11.955 --> 00:10:14.651
If you didn't, I couldn't play tag with you!

00:10:14.958 --> 00:10:17.620
The thing is, we can also do this!

00:10:20.964 --> 00:10:21.896
You won't escape!

00:10:24.701 --> 00:10:26.536
Outta the way! Outta the way!

00:10:26.536 --> 00:10:27.671
Why, you!

00:10:27.671 --> 00:10:30.974
Stop it, you idiot! What about all the
collateral damage you're causing?!

00:10:30.974 --> 00:10:33.408
I told you! Wear him out,

00:10:33.477 --> 00:10:35.512
then corner him someplace
you can easily capture him!

00:10:35.512 --> 00:10:37.446
Jeez, just give it a rest!

00:10:37.714 --> 00:10:40.217
You know we're bad at doing stuff like that!

00:10:40.217 --> 00:10:42.686
Yeah! Let us judge the situation on the ground!

00:10:42.686 --> 00:10:43.687
Kaoru, left!

00:10:43.687 --> 00:10:45.018
Oh, yeah!

00:10:46.223 --> 00:10:47.485
Stop that at once!

00:10:47.991 --> 00:10:49.117
Chief...

00:10:49.693 --> 00:10:53.686
Yeah... I guess we'll be working hard
to get money for the repairs.

00:10:58.035 --> 00:10:58.935
A tunnel?

00:10:58.935 --> 00:10:59.560
I'm going in!

00:11:00.871 --> 00:11:01.496
Wait!

00:11:02.873 --> 00:11:03.737
What's up, Shiho?

00:11:08.445 --> 00:11:11.608
No more tag. He'll be coming back.

00:11:20.590 --> 00:11:22.492
Man... What should we do?

00:11:22.492 --> 00:11:26.096
He's a Level 5, so he probably doesn't
have the strength left to escape.

00:11:26.096 --> 00:11:28.360
Why don't we save him, gently?

00:11:29.266 --> 00:11:31.461
Okay, in that case...

00:11:33.804 --> 00:11:36.295
PSYCHIC FLY SWATTER!

00:11:40.944 --> 00:11:41.876
There we go!

00:11:45.182 --> 00:11:47.582
There's nowhere to run. Just accept it.

00:11:52.756 --> 00:11:54.224
Stay away from me!

00:11:54.224 --> 00:11:56.760
Dammit, what's so great
about you "special espers"?!

00:11:56.760 --> 00:11:59.854
You've had all the breaks!
You can't know what it's like for me!

00:11:59.930 --> 00:12:02.332
Oh, give it a rest, you esper crook!

00:12:02.332 --> 00:12:04.768
Come on, stop this and drop the gun, okay?

00:12:04.768 --> 00:12:07.270
Nobody treasures me like they do you!

00:12:07.270 --> 00:12:10.364
These powers have never brought
me anything but misery!

00:12:10.874 --> 00:12:13.376
What's wrong with using them to get even?!

00:12:13.376 --> 00:12:17.948
Only a handful of espers like
you can ever be happy!

00:12:17.948 --> 00:12:20.382
I wish I didn't have this power!

00:12:21.017 --> 00:12:24.421
If I'd been born a normal person,
I wouldn't be here!

00:12:24.421 --> 00:12:25.756
You're wrong!

00:12:25.756 --> 00:12:27.053
Who are you?

00:12:29.726 --> 00:12:31.628
You were the one who chose to make...

00:12:31.628 --> 00:12:34.256
the powers you were granted into a curse!

00:12:34.397 --> 00:12:37.525
You possess all that power,
so quit whining about it!

00:12:39.035 --> 00:12:39.831
Minamoto...

00:12:40.137 --> 00:12:43.240
Why don't you try to make
a future for yourself?!

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:44.298
You espers...

00:12:44.541 --> 00:12:48.033
No, every person can be anything, go anywhere!

00:12:50.680 --> 00:12:51.908
Kaoru, now!

00:12:54.084 --> 00:12:54.880
Gotcha!

00:12:58.188 --> 00:13:01.124
Well done. Good job.

00:13:01.124 --> 00:13:02.025
Hey!

00:13:02.025 --> 00:13:04.755
We can be anything. We can go anywhere.

00:13:05.395 --> 00:13:06.730
That's right.

00:13:06.730 --> 00:13:09.466
Because we're the most powerful espers.

00:13:09.466 --> 00:13:11.627
Thank you, Mr. Minamoto.

00:13:14.971 --> 00:13:16.598
Girls...

00:13:18.642 --> 00:13:20.507
Let's leave this for the cops.

00:13:25.248 --> 00:13:28.685
That's right. I'm with you.

00:13:28.685 --> 00:13:32.451
I always will be, until you're grown.

00:13:32.856 --> 00:13:35.484
Thanks for everything, Minamoto.

00:13:37.093 --> 00:13:38.028
We...

00:13:38.028 --> 00:13:39.062
will always...

00:13:39.062 --> 00:13:40.927
be friends.

00:13:42.766 --> 00:13:45.667
Absolutely Lovely Children!

00:13:59.549 --> 00:14:03.854
I turn to the front, embracing the dream.

00:14:03.854 --> 00:14:08.692
Making up my mind, looking up to the sky.

00:14:08.692 --> 00:14:14.097
I'll fly beyond the future with my wings.

00:14:14.097 --> 00:14:16.833
Chief, please don't make such a scene.

00:14:16.833 --> 00:14:19.369
I want to bawl my eyes out, too.

00:14:19.369 --> 00:14:21.404
Well, what else can you expect?

00:14:21.404 --> 00:14:23.773
All the more so, considering how
much trouble those girls were.

00:14:23.773 --> 00:14:25.575
Right, Minamoto?

00:14:25.575 --> 00:14:27.344
Not... Not really.

00:14:27.344 --> 00:14:30.280
I'm not going to cry over an
elementary school graduation.

00:14:30.280 --> 00:14:33.545
And I'm not even their parent, s-so...

00:14:34.150 --> 00:14:36.720
Quit holding it in and just cry, already.

00:14:36.720 --> 00:14:38.847
I won't tell them you did.

00:14:42.826 --> 00:14:45.795
Dammit! Those little brats...

00:14:46.997 --> 00:14:50.763
have vanished forever, haven't they?

00:14:53.637 --> 00:14:55.572
How was it, Minamoto?

00:14:55.572 --> 00:14:57.674
Did you cry? You did, didn't you?

00:14:57.674 --> 00:14:59.242
Your eyes are red.

00:14:59.242 --> 00:15:00.911
Be honest!

00:15:00.911 --> 00:15:03.175
Get off my back! I didn't cry, you idiots!

00:15:05.181 --> 00:15:08.275
Look, I've got photographic proof.

00:15:08.518 --> 00:15:10.120
Whoa! He's bawling!

00:15:10.120 --> 00:15:11.644
Hey! TRAITOR!

00:15:15.625 --> 00:15:16.726
Thank you.

00:15:16.726 --> 00:15:18.557
Thank you, Mr. Minamoto.

00:15:19.095 --> 00:15:23.532
For making it possible for us
to go to school and graduate.

00:15:24.134 --> 00:15:26.261
For cooking us meals every day.

00:15:26.703 --> 00:15:29.228
For helping us study and playing with us.

00:15:31.341 --> 00:15:36.438
We really, really thank you for
everything you've done, Minamoto.

00:15:37.280 --> 00:15:39.942
You girls... You really?

00:15:40.317 --> 00:15:41.651
Now, Mom!

00:15:41.651 --> 00:15:42.786
Daddy!

00:15:42.786 --> 00:15:44.583
Hop to it, Dad!

00:15:44.955 --> 00:15:48.425
We're more pros at having pictures
taken of us than taking them, but...

00:15:48.425 --> 00:15:49.693
Leave this to me, Shiho!

00:15:49.693 --> 00:15:50.894
Don't forget about me!

00:15:50.894 --> 00:15:55.231
That's it, let the real you out!
I'll send you to paradise!

00:15:55.231 --> 00:15:58.435
Why don't we change costumes now?!
How about this?!

00:15:58.435 --> 00:16:01.268
Behold the skills of the Metropolitan Police
photo contest gold prize winner!

00:16:01.504 --> 00:16:03.438
My telephoto lens will get him!

00:16:03.773 --> 00:16:05.909
Don't tease adults!

00:16:05.909 --> 00:16:08.278
And what's your excuse?!

00:16:08.278 --> 00:16:10.146
Well, they're our daughters, so...

00:16:10.146 --> 00:16:13.309
Hey, guys! Let's get a group shot!

00:16:13.817 --> 00:16:14.715
Sure!

00:16:17.821 --> 00:16:21.052
Man... Still doing the same stuff.

00:16:21.691 --> 00:16:24.894
Or maybe they've matured beyond their years?

00:16:24.894 --> 00:16:27.055
I really never can tell with them...

00:16:30.700 --> 00:16:32.827
Congratulations, Queen.

00:16:34.237 --> 00:16:39.834
"Graduation yearbook entry,"
by Kaoru Akashi, class 6-3.

00:16:41.711 --> 00:16:48.344
We came to Rokujoin Elementary
when we were still in the 4th grade.

00:16:49.519 --> 00:16:53.656
"Will we make friends?", we wondered.
"Will we get along with our teachers?"

00:16:53.656 --> 00:16:54.591
It was so exciting, and somehow,
I'm getting that same feeling again.

00:16:54.591 --> 00:16:58.962
You in front, can you move in a little?
It was so exciting, and somehow,
I'm getting that same feeling again.

00:16:58.962 --> 00:17:00.987
Okay, that's great.

00:17:01.097 --> 00:17:04.567
Hey, Mr. Minamoto really is cool, isn't he?

00:17:04.567 --> 00:17:05.295
What?

00:17:05.835 --> 00:17:07.504
Well, you know...

00:17:07.504 --> 00:17:08.638
He's our lover!

00:17:08.638 --> 00:17:09.939
Or something.

00:17:09.939 --> 00:17:11.930
Quit talking and look this way!

00:17:12.308 --> 00:17:13.502
Okay!

00:17:14.644 --> 00:17:18.375
In April, we become middle school students.

00:17:18.815 --> 00:17:24.344
We still have no idea what
awaits us in the days to come.

00:17:24.754 --> 00:17:27.190
Okay! Everyone ready?

00:17:27.190 --> 00:17:28.817
Right! Say cheese!

00:17:30.727 --> 00:17:33.263
But with these friends I wouldn't
trade for anything...

00:17:33.263 --> 00:17:36.066
and the people around me that I treasure,

00:17:36.066 --> 00:17:39.058
I plan to build a bright future.

00:17:40.003 --> 00:17:45.308
Because, after all,
we can be anything, and go anywhere.

00:17:49.879 --> 00:17:51.714
Oh! There she is.

00:17:51.714 --> 00:17:55.013
Say, Naomi? Want to grab
some tea on the way home?

00:17:55.652 --> 00:17:56.346
Sure!

00:17:57.020 --> 00:17:59.322
Huh? What sort of dorm do you live in?

00:17:59.322 --> 00:18:00.557
Well...

00:18:00.557 --> 00:18:02.492
You must have a curfew.

00:18:02.492 --> 00:18:05.028
Oh, that's not a problem these days.

00:18:05.028 --> 00:18:07.931
My supervisor is very understanding.

00:18:07.931 --> 00:18:08.727
Supervisor?

00:18:08.965 --> 00:18:12.102
I must be strong! Gotta deal with it...

00:18:12.102 --> 00:18:14.137
Naomi's in college now!

00:18:14.137 --> 00:18:17.540
If I'm too annoying and pushy,
she'll end up hating me!

00:18:17.540 --> 00:18:19.075
Shut up, you son of a bitch!

00:18:19.075 --> 00:18:21.678
Hell has a curfew,
and you're breaking it! Get lost!

00:18:21.678 --> 00:18:24.806
Just my Naomi, my heaven...

00:18:25.648 --> 00:18:27.513
So, what were we talking about?

00:18:28.251 --> 00:18:31.087
Tanizaki really is trouble for us.

00:18:31.087 --> 00:18:34.955
Maybe we should keep him away
from kids. Or just from Naomi.

00:18:35.492 --> 00:18:37.260
Oh, Dr. Sakaki!

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:40.195
You're combing your hair
forward now. It looks nice.

00:18:40.530 --> 00:18:43.233
Hi! Actually, it's kind of a pain.

00:18:43.233 --> 00:18:47.837
I did it to look older, so my patients
and the nurses would take me seriously,

00:18:47.837 --> 00:18:52.542
but all my lady friends say they liked
how young my old style made me look.

00:18:52.542 --> 00:18:53.600
Oh, I see...

00:18:53.943 --> 00:18:57.947
Why don't you try giving yourself
some bangs, Ms. Kashiwagi?

00:18:57.947 --> 00:19:00.882
I bet you'd look a lot younger
and livelier than you do now.

00:19:01.885 --> 00:19:04.911
Really... Bangs could do all that for me, huh?

00:19:05.788 --> 00:19:07.415
K-Kashiwagi?

00:19:07.690 --> 00:19:09.157
Cheers!

00:19:11.961 --> 00:19:15.165
Wow, you absolutely should wear contacts.

00:19:15.165 --> 00:19:18.401
Or get LASIK! Kenjirou Hata had that done, too!

00:19:18.401 --> 00:19:20.403
Please, you're embarrassing me!

00:19:20.403 --> 00:19:22.505
Hey, can I have your e-mail address?

00:19:22.505 --> 00:19:24.474
Your little fangs are adorable!

00:19:24.474 --> 00:19:26.806
Don't say that! You're making me self conscious!

00:19:28.578 --> 00:19:31.548
Thank you for coming... Gah!

00:19:31.548 --> 00:19:34.073
But inside you're thinking
"You people are a pain", aren't you?!

00:19:34.150 --> 00:19:35.685
Don't underestimate espers!

00:19:35.685 --> 00:19:37.921
Some nights, you just wanna drink alone!

00:19:37.921 --> 00:19:39.388
Shoulda worn my lucky underwear!

00:19:40.423 --> 00:19:42.659
Okay, we're going out for field training.

00:19:42.659 --> 00:19:44.594
Are you two ready?

00:19:44.594 --> 00:19:45.228
Yes!

00:19:45.228 --> 00:19:47.063
Communicator, handkerchief, tissues...

00:19:47.063 --> 00:19:48.998
Hatsune's chikuwa cakes, for snacks!

00:19:48.998 --> 00:19:52.302
And a scooper and plastic bags! We're all set!

00:19:52.302 --> 00:19:54.600
Is that for me?

00:19:55.939 --> 00:20:00.610
Yes? We'll be training with two new recruits?

00:20:00.610 --> 00:20:03.374
No, it's fine, but who are they?

00:20:04.514 --> 00:20:06.448
Take care, you two.

00:20:07.083 --> 00:20:11.281
Work hard at being special espers. Do your best!

00:20:14.190 --> 00:20:17.493
Oh! The Sea of Serenity is beautiful!

00:20:17.493 --> 00:20:20.863
Looks like construction on the
lunar station is going well.

00:20:20.863 --> 00:20:23.161
I'd like to tell Minamoto, too.

00:20:29.339 --> 00:20:33.676
Ah... It's nice to have things so
quiet around here for a change.

00:20:33.676 --> 00:20:37.077
Really, really! It's so relaxing.

00:20:40.083 --> 00:20:41.384
By the way, new girl!

00:20:41.384 --> 00:20:43.750
What are you standing there
daydreaming about?

00:20:44.254 --> 00:20:46.723
Say, Yoh, about the training program...

00:20:46.723 --> 00:20:49.692
for those new recruits we scouted overseas...

00:20:49.926 --> 00:20:53.327
Oh... That's such a pain. You deal with it, Magi!

00:20:57.934 --> 00:21:00.164
That's how you see them?

00:21:01.571 --> 00:21:03.061
I'm home.

00:21:05.074 --> 00:21:08.771
God, Normals have the worst fashion sense.

00:21:10.613 --> 00:21:12.376
Um, who are you?

00:21:13.416 --> 00:21:16.586
Oh! How can you live
wearing such awful clothes?!

00:21:16.586 --> 00:21:18.520
Your tastes need to be more normal!

00:21:26.996 --> 00:21:31.296
Igo... Even if your predictions
are supposed to be perfect,

00:21:31.734 --> 00:21:33.827
I felt it that time.

00:21:33.903 --> 00:21:36.770
The power Kaoru and the others
have to change the future.

00:21:38.074 --> 00:21:40.065
Wherever you are, watch over us.

00:21:40.143 --> 00:21:43.078
See the battle we in BABEL have yet to fight.

00:21:46.883 --> 00:21:50.853
Soon, we'll be all be here
together as middle-schoolers.

00:21:50.853 --> 00:21:53.014
I'm looking forward to being
in school with you again, Tono.

00:21:54.824 --> 00:21:56.659
Still, it's kind of strange that Akashi...

00:21:56.659 --> 00:21:58.752
and the others are going to same school as us.

00:22:07.337 --> 00:22:08.998
Yuri!

00:22:09.072 --> 00:22:11.836
You already got your uniform?
You can't wait, can you?

00:22:13.376 --> 00:22:14.502
I'm looking forward to it.

00:22:15.044 --> 00:22:15.945
Who's she?

00:22:15.945 --> 00:22:17.914
She was in our exam prep classes.

00:22:17.914 --> 00:22:20.382
Did you forget about Yuri?

00:22:21.384 --> 00:22:22.851
She was?

00:22:24.554 --> 00:22:26.920
Uh-oh, it's almost time.

00:22:27.623 --> 00:22:30.727
Yeah. Well, later, Yuri!

00:22:30.727 --> 00:22:33.093
See you at the entrance ceremony!

00:22:35.465 --> 00:22:37.797
You've come, Kaoru...

00:22:40.236 --> 00:22:43.139
We'll be on-site, shortly. Stand by!

00:22:43.139 --> 00:22:43.730
Roger.

00:22:44.374 --> 00:22:48.708
The Precogs say there's a
90% chance it'll occur. However...

00:22:49.245 --> 00:22:52.248
Right! I know you girls can prevent it!

00:22:52.248 --> 00:22:53.216
Do your best.

00:22:53.216 --> 00:22:53.910
Right!

00:22:54.217 --> 00:22:56.549
Special espers, The Children!

00:22:57.186 --> 00:22:58.016
Released!

00:22:58.121 --> 00:22:58.644
<<RELEASED>>

00:23:02.425 --> 00:23:04.154
We're absolutely lovely!

00:23:04.794 --> 00:23:06.193
So we never lose!

00:23:07.363 --> 00:23:09.524
Let's head toward tomorrow!

00:23:09.766 --> 00:23:12.599
Over the future world!

00:23:15.571 --> 00:23:18.233
You're glad we chose miniskirts,
aren't you, Minamoto?

00:23:18.775 --> 00:23:21.039
Don't be ridiculous! Don't tease adults!

00:23:21.344 --> 00:23:24.643
She really isn't going to change,
even if we are in middle school now.

00:23:25.214 --> 00:23:28.551
So what if she doesn't? That's how Kaoru is.

00:23:28.551 --> 00:23:33.648
Okay, then! PSYCHIC SUPERSONIC CHARGE!

00:23:40.029 --> 00:23:40.963
NEXT EPISODE,
WHICH CANNOT BE MISSED!

00:23:40.963 --> 00:23:41.964
NEXT EPISODE,
WHICH CANNOT BE MISSED!
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:41.964 --> 00:23:42.953
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:43.266 --> 00:23:46.102
To all our friends in front of their TVs,
thanks for your support!

00:23:46.102 --> 00:23:47.103
I'm Natsuko Tokiwa!

00:23:47.103 --> 00:23:48.271
And I'm Hotaru Nowaki!

00:23:48.271 --> 00:23:49.738
Next up is a special episode.

00:23:49.939 --> 00:23:51.507
As esper intelligence agents,

00:23:51.507 --> 00:23:55.044
we're going to reveal all sorts of
things that happen around BABEL!

00:23:55.044 --> 00:23:57.447
You absolutely cannot miss it!

00:23:57.447 --> 00:23:59.315
Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:59.315 --> 00:24:04.053
Special episode: "A Grand Banquet!
Natsuko and Hotaru's BABEL Report!"

00:24:04.053 --> 00:24:04.951
Don't miss it!

00:24:06.722 --> 00:24:06.889
A Grand Banquet!
Natsuko and Hotaru's BABEL Report!

00:24:06.889 --> 00:24:08.624
A Grand Banquet!
Natsuko and Hotaru's BABEL Report!
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:08.624 --> 00:24:09.318
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!
